        "start_sec": 28.5,
        "end_sec": 36.0,
        "duration_sec": 7.5
      },
      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-5",
        "beat_id": "beat-5",
        "scene_id": "scene-04",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "From that brighter, water vapor is tricky. It can hide behind clouds or mimic other gases. We need multiple bands to confirm. So.",
        "emotion": "",
        "action": "",
        "location": "",
